<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, reconciled from independent Tibetan-first and English-first proposals; not human-approved. The opponent grants validity to human visual perception but denies it to the other two beings on the basis of karma. Both visual-consciousness and valid-perception occurrences retain their distinct owners. The complete reporting phrase kho na re owns Someone may answer at d3; the expanded with the following claim and closing zer na are distributed reporting and remain unwrapped. gnyis owns two, leaving types of and latter supplied. bzang ngan is the established paired-quality compound, with the exact HGM variant good in one case, and bad in the other; bzang/good and ngan/bad are tighter members. The two contrasted karmas license this distributive rendering; which is remains supplied. dbang gis owns forces as the established inflected force expression; them to remains supplied. sogs owns the complete indefinite exemplifying gesture something like at particle depth, without claiming either example noun. yin is treated as the copular word at d5. las/karma is direct GMR attestation supported by the original glossary; the curated deeds/deed entry is unchanged. Unselected cases and copular/reporting expansions are omitted without an uncertain null. All original source wording is preserved.</div>
